desc: Babalon Chord FM Synth (Valley Dexter port) by chmaha
tags: instrument synthesizer fm wavetable chord
author: chmaha
version: 1.1
changelog:
  Add full copyright and licence header (upstream authors' notices).
about:
  Four-operator wavetable FM voice with 23 algorithms, operator sync and phase shaping, playing chords of up to
  seven notes (Voice A) plus a second voice (Voice B) for every MIDI note.
  Ported from Valley Dexter by Dale Johnson (ValleyRackFree, https://github.com/ValleyAudio/ValleyRackFree,
  GPLv3+). Wavetables, panel artwork and algorithm diagrams from Dexter (Dependencies/Babalon).
  Title lettering: Zarathustra by Lorene Ceccon (SIL Open Font License 1.1), rendered into the panel image.
  Background: adapted from "Divina Madre" by Paulo de Loyola (deviantart.com/deloyola), CC BY-SA 3.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/); the adapted images (BabalonMark*.png, BabalonEyes*.png, BabalonCrown*.png, BabalonPlate*.png, BabalonHalo*.png) are under the same licence.
  JSFX version released under GPLv3+ license
  Claude generated some of this code
provides:
  Dependencies/Babalon/Babalon.flac
  Dependencies/Babalon/BabalonPanel.png
  Dependencies/Babalon/BabalonPanel2x.png
